# The manual's Getting started, step by step: each step as the manual words it, checked.
wait 300
# 1. X0X opens on the 909. PLAY: the two 303s play their factory lines (no drums yet)
expect view 1
expect part 0
tap PLAY
wait 500
expect playing 1
# 2. a kick: black key 1, then white keys 1, 5, 9, 13
tapkey b0
tapkey w0
tapkey w4
tapkey w8
tapkey w12
expect hit0.0.0 1
expect hit0.0.12 1
# 3. a clap: black key 7, white keys 5 and 13
tapkey b6
tapkey w4
tapkey w12
expect hit0.6.4 1
expect hit0.6.12 1
# 4. open hats: black key 9, white keys 3, 7, 11, 15
tapkey b8
tapkey w2
tapkey w6
tapkey w10
tapkey w14
expect hit0.8.2 1
expect hit0.8.14 1
# 5. a new 303 line: ALGORITHM two clicks clockwise to 303A, ARP, OCT+
turn ALGO 2
expect part 2
tap ARP
expect view 2
tap OCT+
# 6. shape it: EDIT (FILTER page), KNOB 1 cutoff, KNOB 2 resonance
tap EDIT
expect view 1
turn K1 10
turn K2 -10
expect sound2.0.0 58
expect sound2.0.1 90
# 7. the break: ALGORITHM two more clicks to BREAK, all sixteen white keys
turn ALGO 2
expect part 4
tapkey w0
tapkey w1
tapkey w2
tapkey w3
tapkey w4
tapkey w5
tapkey w6
tapkey w7
tapkey w8
tapkey w9
tapkey w10
tapkey w11
tapkey w12
tapkey w13
tapkey w14
tapkey w15
expect brk0 1
expect brk15 1
# 8. quiet 303B: HOME, black key 4
tap HOME
expect view 0
tapkey b3
expect mute 8388608
# 9. record a filter sweep: ALGORITHM back to 303A, REC, turn KNOB 1, REC
turn ALGO -2
expect part 2
expect view 1
tap REC
turn K1 -20
tap REC
expect lanes 1
shot gs_motion.png
# 10. save
tap SAVE
expect store_writes 6
